(`checks update`), not bundled. The template format, DSL functions, and interactsh-style
matchers follow Nuclei and interactsh (https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei,
https://github.com/projectdiscovery/interactsh), Copyright (c) 2020 ProjectDiscovery, Inc.,
MIT License.

